        `${chalk.dim('The veil parts once more. A new mirror reflects...')}`,
        `${chalk.dim('The residue of the last encounter lingers. The next catalyst forms...')}`,
        `${chalk.dim('Memory folds into potential. A new edge of growth appears...')}`,
